00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:22.280
Without a map, without a compass...

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:21.790
Yang:

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:21.790
Goda Hozumi

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:27.370
...we set out on a voyage

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:36.720
Not a journey to find something that's already been found

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:32.970
Cazellnu:

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:32.970
Ki-ton Yamada

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:37.610
